      "value": "@{600f0e36b257ed443f54f640|full_name}: You cannot honestly compare CVR to VRC as these two are very different in terms of a playerbase. CVR doesn't hit the same player count concurrently as VRChat, and VRC has a lot more players so people will rip more from VRC compared to CVR where less than 150 people are online. There is some credibility into criticizing EAC but that's moreso irrelevant to the conversation. People get mad about their avatars getting ripped, especially since I put more effort into my shit, but there's not much that can be done about that and I honestly think it's a huge waste of time and resources. And your method would only be applied to new uploads, not old ones.",
